-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under AU-C 240.A1, the fraud risk triangle identifies three conditions generally present when fraud occurs: incentive or pressure, opportunity, and rationalization. The auditor considers these conditions when assessing fraud risk during planning and risk assessment procedures.
