Wrong (C): Detection, prevention, and correction are internal control objectives, not fraud risk conditions identified by AU-C 240.
Wrong (D): Authorization, recording, and custody relate to segregation of duties concepts, not the three conditions of the fraud risk triangle.$EXPL$
