-- Q1501: Risk Assessment [easy/L1]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under AU-C 240.A38, the auditor is required to incorporate an element of unpredictability in the selection of auditing procedures to address fraud risk. This may include performing procedures at unexpected times, at unannounced locations, using different sampling methods, or testing areas not typically examined.
