  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under AU-C 265.09-.10, the auditor is required to communicate in writing to both management and those charged with governance any material weaknesses and significant deficiencies identified during the audit. This written communication must be made on a timely basis to allow appropriate corrective action.
Wrong (A): Communicating only to management would be insufficient; AU-C 265 requires that those charged with governance also receive written notification of material weaknesses.
